{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t北角發生致命交通意外，一名男子被一輛巴士撞倒，送院搶救後不治。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方在早上8時許接報，一輛城巴沿英皇道東行，當駛至電廠街交界時，撞倒一名男途人，他受傷昏迷，送東區醫院搶救後死亡。警方正調查意外原因。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.455861+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T02:07:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:36:09.489825+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:40.602090+00:00","content_hash":"f453ed2c6069da0d2d82214118ca88563fabe6a31045f7440bb5492d21095097","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}